Z||000010||rogergarrison||06-27-2001||10:29 PM||||I dont know about alcohol on plastic, but i have used it on lexan OK. Baby, you must have some tough tape glue, cause i use alcohol to take off everything from window film glue, to glue from pinstripes. Try just using some polish/wax on it, that should take it off too with some rubbing.||||reg||1
