Z||000013||stsmithgt||06-28-2001||07:53 PM||||I'd be careful what you clean lexan with.  Not that you would, but if you used something as harsh as carb cleaner to clean lexan with, it will change the lexan at a molecular level and instead of being flexible and strong, it will make it brittle and crack.  I'd have to talk to my brother about that for more details.  He deals with lexan fairings on motorcycles at work all the time.(well, not ALL the time) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Just be carefull where you splash cleansers.||||reg||1
